{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An endless tower defense built around irreversible decisions and broken synergies.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astro Company is an endless low-poly tower defense roguelike where you defend a central Core against relentless waves of asteroids, ships, and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only build between waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some towers require multiple waves to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide too late - and you won\u2019t survive to see them finished.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/19a5c4add8c641a3a3931a527df440be.avif?t=1771704665\" width=1536 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No panic-building under pressure. Construction is only possible during the short breaks between enemy assaults.<br>Every Processing Unit, every Miner, and every tower placement matters.<br>Some towers take several waves to complete - commit early and hope you survive long enough to finish them.<br>Up to approximately the <strong>30th wave</strong>, you expand your base and prepare your defenses -<br>after that comes the <strong>final phase</strong>, where survival is all that matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/121d9599ea345fd939fb5778943b884a.avif?t=1771704665\" width=1536 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a few waves, fate offers you a choice.<br>Pick one of several random cards: new projectiles, mining bonuses, Core upgrades\u2026<br>Sometimes you will even encounter <strong>legendary cards</strong>, powerful enough to completely transform a tower into something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/25c243c1feea7c513b77c215a3c744e8.poster.avif?t=1771704665\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/25c243c1feea7c513b77c215a3c744e8.webm?t=1771704665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/25c243c1feea7c513b77c215a3c744e8.mp4?t=1771704665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/b4a3e393ede52337c88ac7874f6f9c18.avif?t=1771704665\" width=1536 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrap, iron, and crystals fuel your survival.<br>Place Miners on asteroids to gather resources - but every Miner means one less combat tower.<br>Do you invest in your economy now, or in firepower to survive the next wave?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/d388c1625f81f4d9c70c89923570de43.avif?t=1771704665\" width=1536 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From drifting asteroids to armed ships and terrifying bosses - every wave is more demanding.<br>Some enemies shoot back, others summon reinforcements or require entirely new tactics.<br>After the <strong>30th wave</strong>, the endless mode begins - stronger enemies, tougher bosses, and the true test of your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/ba4f320675763df48593951978614d46.poster.avif?t=1771704665\" width=800 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/ba4f320675763df48593951978614d46.webm?t=1771704665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/ba4f320675763df48593951978614d46.mp4?t=1771704665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/15fb11f64118a75386080f406f46d020.avif?t=1771704665\" width=1536 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run rewards you with more than just a score.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new towers with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover common, rare, and legendary cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start runs with bonus resources or Processing Units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn permanent meta-upgrades that help you push further</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/92856e51b8660f62ba596319e804d6f3.avif?t=1771704665\" width=1536 height=90 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless tower defense survival in a stylized low-poly universe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No panic-building - construction is only possible between waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Irreversible decisions - some towers require multiple waves to complete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike cards - every run reshapes towers, the Core, and the rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broken synergies - combine effects until the game starts fighting back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless scaling - the longer you survive, the more unfair it becomes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How long can your Core survive before everything collapses?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the first fragile tower in wave one to the chaos of wave thirty and beyond -<br>every decision determines whether you survive.<br><br>Add <strong>ASTROCOMPANY</strong> to your wishlist and join the endless defense.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4042610?t=1771704665","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/160a4e85bf681cc0056b42cf5433eb6a5e3c837b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771704665","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/b2e895a3e1b5245a70ab777708fa5c01c3811249/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771704665","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/b2e895a3e1b5245a70ab777708fa5c01c3811249/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771704665","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An endless tower defense built around irreversible decisions and broken synergies.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astro Company is an endless low-poly tower defense roguelike where you defend a central Core against relentless waves of asteroids, ships, and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only build between waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some towers require multiple waves to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide too late - and you won\u2019t survive to see them finished.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/19a5c4add8c641a3a3931a527df440be.avif?t=1771704665\" width=1536 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No panic-building under pressure. Construction is only possible during the short breaks between enemy assaults.<br>Every Processing Unit, every Miner, and every tower placement matters.<br>Some towers take several waves to complete - commit early and hope you survive long enough to finish them.<br>Up to approximately the <strong>30th wave</strong>, you expand your base and prepare your defenses -<br>after that comes the <strong>final phase</strong>, where survival is all that matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/121d9599ea345fd939fb5778943b884a.avif?t=1771704665\" width=1536 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a few waves, fate offers you a choice.<br>Pick one of several random cards: new projectiles, mining bonuses, Core upgrades\u2026<br>Sometimes you will even encounter <strong>legendary cards</strong>, powerful enough to completely transform a tower into something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/25c243c1feea7c513b77c215a3c744e8.poster.avif?t=1771704665\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/25c243c1feea7c513b77c215a3c744e8.webm?t=1771704665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/25c243c1feea7c513b77c215a3c744e8.mp4?t=1771704665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/b4a3e393ede52337c88ac7874f6f9c18.avif?t=1771704665\" width=1536 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrap, iron, and crystals fuel your survival.<br>Place Miners on asteroids to gather resources - but every Miner means one less combat tower.<br>Do you invest in your economy now, or in firepower to survive the next wave?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/d388c1625f81f4d9c70c89923570de43.avif?t=1771704665\" width=1536 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From drifting asteroids to armed ships and terrifying bosses - every wave is more demanding.<br>Some enemies shoot back, others summon reinforcements or require entirely new tactics.<br>After the <strong>30th wave</strong>, the endless mode begins - stronger enemies, tougher bosses, and the true test of your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/ba4f320675763df48593951978614d46.poster.avif?t=1771704665\" width=800 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/ba4f320675763df48593951978614d46.webm?t=1771704665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/ba4f320675763df48593951978614d46.mp4?t=1771704665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/15fb11f64118a75386080f406f46d020.avif?t=1771704665\" width=1536 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run rewards you with more than just a score.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new towers with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover common, rare, and legendary cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start runs with bonus resources or Processing Units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn permanent meta-upgrades that help you push further</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/92856e51b8660f62ba596319e804d6f3.avif?t=1771704665\" width=1536 height=90 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless tower defense survival in a stylized low-poly universe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No panic-building - construction is only possible between waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Irreversible decisions - some towers require multiple waves to complete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike cards - every run reshapes towers, the Core, and the rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broken synergies - combine effects until the game starts fighting back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless scaling - the longer you survive, the more unfair it becomes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How long can your Core survive before everything collapses?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the first fragile tower in wave one to the chaos of wave thirty and beyond -<br>every decision determines whether you survive.<br><br>Add <strong>ASTROCOMPANY</strong> to your wishlist and join the endless defense.</p>","developers":["Elephant Arts"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/1414c79bb1ee492bcb6faacfbac5f3413e8fea6a/header.jpg?t=1771704665","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"